          "transcript_raw": "I recently opened an account with N26 after using Revolut for several years. The beginning of the process was straightforward because the app explained every step clearly. Identity verification was fast, although I had to repeat the video verification once because the lighting was poor. What frustrated me most was not knowing how long the account approval would take. After verification there was almost no communication. I kept checking the app because I didn't know whether something was happening in the background. Once the account became active everything worked well, but I think the onboarding could provide better progress updates and clearer expectations. I would also appreciate a short checklist showing which steps are completed and what still remains. Overall the experience was positive, but there were moments of uncertainty that reduced my confidence during onboarding.",
